te]} {:db/id "q-164474" :question/id #uuid "409c6f40-648e-50d1-9c75-8b4b95b93e61" :question/math-academy-id "q-164474" :question/problem "Identify the following surface: \n\n$$\n(x+1)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}-(z-1)^{2}=1\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of a hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $O$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1,\n$$\n\nand a hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-{x}_{0})^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-{y}_{0})^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{(z-{z}_{0})^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1,\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is a hyperboloid of one sheet with the following parameters:\n\n$$\n({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(-1,3,1),\\,a=b=c=1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-164474/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9840265f-02bf-58fa-94fd-77fb970af297"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-164474"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-164476/selection/a0b11e0e4cb93ba7252e4938f17e6542a6efe826431c412c9481913c5acc6ab1" :answer/id #uuid "9c95281d-3d3b-55d7-ad2e-cab87b0628a7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperboloid of one sheet" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164476/selection/d31ad39935ff9d2b0053e736fe3ac4359b7ccfba0b1fa70ac15346daf95df63f" :answer/id #uuid "adbd99ef-83bd-5958-b7e8-8d1f72348506" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbolic cylinder" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164476/selection/116fdb5fbaa2ff610a270aa7ffc0c36b0d7b29f0ba61b321ae46a834eaad3f7e" :answer/id #uuid "1acf8187-cb9d-5cb7-a0d8-d7817eea5b37" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperboloid of two sheets" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164476/selection/d75c85b2503ed0099aad81b1b67dae5234ba71bcf5b076be8cdc6fdfefdfbe33" :answer/id #uuid "a86735e7-3b4b-5ff2-9230-a8799bea55d3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An