ose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164510/selection/2513d2cc16936d3911afa81ad3298debfc0982cf93599614580d0beaba3996a4" :answer/id #uuid "04c62c20-9921-5ea0-9e23-779897aadfcd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbolic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164510/selection/5a23e61931ff9a05faa546f1b2ebcae9f928732a80c0c0a51029bfef28efe5bc" :answer/id #uuid "20d415a6-3946-54d9-b649-a0577945abba" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164510/selection/7f49c01dc49e99d8577e13db2f37b0ccc0841922765c410f0f794d46b2ca4f09" :answer/id #uuid "e514088a-8e29-5121-b14a-a35d22def77c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164510/selection/2da3925cc8fedff8b5b003e55fba33f0ca025b98a9a2cc17dca07ddb164c0337" :answer/id #uuid "9095ca39-7a82-5dfc-bdec-91a163ad9787" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164510/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "74a2e19c-d360-5dd6-b691-33b53c190f0e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-164510/selection/5a23e61931ff9a05faa546f1b2ebcae9f928732a80c0c0a51029bfef28efe5bc" :answer-field/choices ["q-164510/selection/097ad2ff4f897b5463c198a6d7c15b6bf1833acb11fe6f28fc221274e6632158" "q-164510/selection/2513d2cc16936d3911afa81ad3298debfc0982cf93599614580d0beaba3996a4" "q-164510/selection/5a23e61931ff9a05faa546f1b2ebcae9f928732a80c0c0a51029bfef28efe5bc" "q-164510/selection/7f49c01dc49e99d8577e13db2f37b0ccc0841922765c410f0f794d46b2ca4f09" "q-164510/selection/2da3925cc8fedff8b5b003e55fba33f0ca025b98a9a2cc17dca07ddb164c0337"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-164510" :question/id #uuid "e5a75c9b-5dbc-5d66-b2ec-39592397a14a" :question/math-academy-id "q-164510" :question/problem "Identify the surface $x=\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{4}.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of an elliptic paraboloid centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nThus, an elliptic paraboloid centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is an elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis and $b=\\sqrt{2},\\,c=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-164510/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89fbf42b-d171-5772-87ce-cf622b720963"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-164510"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-164373"] :question/problem "Identify the surface ${z}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{x}^{2}=1.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of a hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=-1.\n$$\n\nThus, a hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a hyperboloid of one sheet whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis and $a=b=c=1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-164507/selection/e4c14cfe0c39f664a7a530d2eb29b4f7dff4d93de1033793873a83d494784620" :answer/id #uuid "c7324a2c-c610-568d-af87-b6d3ad72ab1a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}