-a2fb-5fe2be5930e7" :question/math-academy-id "q-164507" :question/problem "Identify the surface ${x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{9}=1.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of a hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nThus, a hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $y$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a hyperboloid of one sheet whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis and $a=1,\\,b=\\frac{1}{2},\\,c=3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-164507/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89fbf42b-d171-5772-87ce-cf622b720963"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-164507"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-164514/selection/2da3925cc8fedff8b5b003e55fba33f0ca025b98a9a2cc17dca07ddb164c0337" :answer/id #uuid "94bd3ba3-8a69-517a-9a7f-72fc8eeddfc1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164514/selection/7f49c01dc49e99d8577e13db2f37b0ccc0841922765c410f0f794d46b2ca4f09" :answer/id #uuid "1bb71857-908c-525a-9470-86241d15d126" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164514/selection/802c472271755dfef70e0c69b6ce7b4af9916fc38dab37d59ce1dd3f85167339" :answer/id #uuid "828e515d-ce16-5926-8119-7d171b72aa52" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperboloid with one sheet whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164514/selection/e4c14cfe0c39f664a7a530d2eb29b4f7dff4d93de1033793873a83d494784620" :answer/id #uuid "c1c71383-7341-5431-8803-5b